uot;&gt;Clients&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__item even&quot;&gt;Marketing&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__item odd&quot;&gt;Project Managers&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;field__item even&quot;&gt;Site Builders&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
